msgctxt "Label for default commission plan rate"
msgid "Default commission rate"
msgstr "デフォルト手数料率"

#: assets/js/admin/admin.js:1
msgctxt "Placeholder to set default commission rate"
msgid "Set amount"
msgstr "設定金額"

#: assets/js/admin/admin.js:1
msgctxt "different type of commission setup description"
msgid "Create unlimited custom commission plans under Affiliate > Plans — based on affiliates, products, referral sources and more."
msgstr "アフィリエイト > プラン]で、アフィリエイト、商品、紹介元などに応じて無制限のカスタムコミッションプランを作成できます。"

