msgstr "払い戻し期間（日）"

#: assets/js/admin/admin.js:1
msgctxt "Refund period setting description"
msgid "Set how many days to wait before paying commission - just in case the order gets refunded. Enter '0' if you don't offer refunds. Referrals in this period will show how many days are left."
